</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Though unworthy, vile, unclean,</l><l>Look and live! look and live!</l><l>Look away from self and sin,</l><l>Look and live!</l><l>Long by Satan’s power enslaved,</l><l>Look and live! look and live!</l><l>Look to Me, ye shall be saved,</l><l>Look and live!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Though you’ve wandered far away,</l><l>Look and live! look and live!</l><l>Harden not your heart today,</l><l>Look and live!</l><l>’Tis thy Father calls thee home,</l><l>Look and live! look and live!</l><l>Whosoever will may come,</l><l>Look and live!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
